---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout current="about" title="About — Small Space Tech"
  description="We buy it, we use it, then we write about it. How Small Space Tech reviews small-room gear.">
  <div class="wrap about" style="padding-top:64px">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <h1>We buy it, we use it, then we write about it.</h1>
      <p>Small Space Tech reviews desks, storage, lighting and power gear for rooms that have to do more than one job. Bedroom corners, studio nooks, the foot of a kid's bed.</p>
      <p>There are no products here we haven't paid for. When something turns out to be a mistake, that goes in the review too — and when a product gets discontinued, we say so rather than quietly swapping in a link that still pays.</p>
      <div class="rules">
        <div class="rule-card"><span class="eyebrow">Rule 01</span><span>Bought with our own money</span></div>
        <div class="rule-card"><span class="eyebrow">Rule 02</span><span>Used in a real small room, not a studio</span></div>
        <div class="rule-card"><span class="eyebrow">Rule 03</span><span>Price paid printed on every review</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="sidecard">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" style="width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;background:#eceef1">
          <defs><pattern id="ap" width="8" height="8" patternTransform="rotate(45)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="8" stroke="#dcdee4" stroke-width="3"/></pattern></defs>
          <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="60" fill="url(#ap)" />
        </svg>
        <span class="eyebrow">photo: you</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <h2>Who writes this</h2>
        <p>Add a line or two here: your name, where you work, and what your own small room looks like. Readers trust a specific person more than a brand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hr"></div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
        <p>Links to retailers may earn a commission at no cost to you. It never changes what we recommend. <a href="/affiliate-disclosure" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline">Read the full policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" style="text-align:center;padding:12px" href="/newsletter">Subscribe</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
